### 1. Test Error Handling (invalid endpoint)
GET http://localhost:5281/invalid-endpoint

###

### 2. Test Authentication - No Token (should fail)
GET http://localhost:5281/users

###

### 3. Test Authentication - Valid Token
GET http://localhost:5281/users
Authorization: valid-token

###

### 4. Test Logging Middleware (valid token, single user)
GET http://localhost:5281/users/1
Authorization: valid-token

###

### 5. Test Validation Errors (invalid payload)
POST http://localhost:5281/users
Authorization: valid-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "department": "Finance"
}

###

### 6. Test Create User (valid payload)
POST http://localhost:5281/users
Authorization: valid-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Eva Green",
  "email": "eva.green@techhive.com",
  "department": "HR"
}

###

### 7. Test Update User (valid payload)
PUT http://localhost:5281/users/1
Authorization: valid-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alice Johnson Updated",
  "email": "alice.updated@techhive.com",
  "department": "IT"
}

###

### 8. Test Delete User (non-existent user)
DELETE http://localhost:5281/users/99
Authorization: valid-token
